<tbody>
<tr>
<td>
<ul>
<li><span>Attend the mandatory EMT orientation meeting</span>
<ul>
<li><span>The next full-quarter EMT orientation meeting is Wednesday, October 28th, 2026, from 1-5pm in room G5, which will be good for enrolling in the Winter, Spring, and Fall '27 quarter EMT sections.&nbsp;</span><span></span></li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<p><span>*<em>more dates TBD throughout the school year - check back here for updates</em></span></p>
<ul>
<li><span>&nbsp;A current CPR/Basic Life Support (BLS) card is now part of the EMT (HEA-140E) course and will be taught on the second day of class. <strong>More information will be provided during the mandatory EMT Orientation Meeting.</strong></span></li>
</ul>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<table class="ou-chevron-list"><caption>Chevron List</caption>
<thead>
<tr>
